{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/dc52enfng1lxithiygy858orcp8319j.mp3","text":"工作就像是陷阱，你得主动跳进去才行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/k0t5kz9ddxzg9zwsr87cz4ez1svi90d.mp3","text":"我不说话只是因为不想，没有看不起谁的意思。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/71omqg67y2qp5tbdwuwf62cnap3oqq1.mp3","text":"月见夜又做什么了，他是不是终于因为在走廊上搭讪遭人讨厌甚至被送进医务室了？没有？真是遗憾。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/05/sa2hnyq2x2t6hg6vwtp7m5rec2sy8vu.mp3","text":"有事吗，博士？我大概能帮上点忙。不过，要是能不占用我用来看漫画的休息时间，当然会更好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/9hagg67zgmvnnev2e7mubt02kepbs6y.mp3","text":"虽然有时候我说话很直接，但该做的事情，我一定会做好。这不关职业道德什么事，只是我觉得连任务都没法完成的人，一定没有用心去做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/l1116upjckwmdau9f7uuw8230zjg991.mp3","text":"罗德岛是个奇怪的地方。这里的人有什么情绪都会说出来，有什么需要帮忙的地方就自然会有人伸出援手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/czuqihp8kdw170tb2z27xv1yqsjy9ky.mp3","text":"虽然A6行动预备组的各位，不是每天摆着张臭脸就是没有自控能力，要么自我意识过剩或者根本是颗移动炸弹，但我依然觉得他们很可靠。因为他们真的在努力，哪怕是偷偷的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/opyqnyqtkvblu5ug8spo2fbu2l6zww2.mp3","text":"我以前也是个像诸位罗德岛干员一样自由自在的人，我的家庭却觉得那样的我是个怪胎。也许这里是个怪胎集合地也说不定，但至少，大家都很快乐。这样也不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/6lfpv97y9zlked9bwg8o0qh13jqirxe.mp3","text":"我可以先回宿舍吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/ee5rncxtfsj8nxt2ihcl5ffasg7arrd.mp3","text":"你好，我是隶属行动预备组A6的斑点，职责大概是保护预备组每天都在闹腾的另外几个家伙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/l4maubczgwncnvum5zjy89hrg7wdyru.mp3","text":"这场战斗我看过，敌人都完蛋了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/ehai7z7ezjxb9sfhwkr8paigkzmx8hp.mp3","text":"我会加倍努力工作的，从0.1到0.2的水平吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/nbjou6ixk5wdwgpspifkjqe5lmnerez.mp3","text":"我就不询问这次作战的意义了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/jsdwxtczzbsvw59mwcgtz9ca6byy32a.mp3","text":"我想回宿舍了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/2jy1dipned2p9qzmlgtldw27xca757l.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/jy5j1xuo492p2c9bk6ei6i8kbtkrnpb.mp3","text":"你们直接投降能节约我很多时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/jxgocxiexg2ot7to6vkyo5ra7fa246m.mp3","text":"怎么样都行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/b7oa0x81m8bpe5kh91mt5ong22c4gxq.mp3","text":"我随便。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/su9zludgu3f0y2kxn7j3v0l4fsx863b.mp3","text":"就这样吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/g5v5jgfczzpwhh30uwicz01ms8gr5wm.mp3","text":"挺好的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/tn7fhxw4ok2jnfy21n68nc91zelw46k.mp3","text":"试试这个。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/hfw24iededqpojifgzdtlzsdtr1lepo.mp3","text":"应该不会伤到队友。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/inq8y8ipqo52g4odjwpyklfndazpdj0.mp3","text":"破绽太多了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/ed2ac4eygfjlqa7ntj24h6wnk8tf3ze.mp3","text":"举盾也是很累的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/bq5vjhf2nd2ktloih0lxcnyepsvvxif.mp3","text":"每当你觉得一场战斗很轻松的时候，就最好再来一次。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/rs6u4izprkss93ywps2oocikeue2ujo.mp3","text":"只要肯努力，就算大脑空空也能做好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/qr8n7bug90myuqa8wmg5oj1195tvlun.mp3","text":"瑕疵是一种必然，从结果来说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/9m4hzckzt1v6iw4bk7d9s487uqi2346.mp3","text":"别紧张，你这样没事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/bfu5hyk90261b9zjw94gm26gkf28xg5.mp3","text":"这样也可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/l6ikhguf09r9geas2dz82wxzytyys4d.mp3","text":"哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/gmt9tlr8p41tcek6fkzaigumn0dffln.mp3","text":"你这样摸，我的毛会打结的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/r1q8pun50dpg4szqlpkocgp5bq6ejun.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/sfwx5yzesyin4vytdivy699zdaeiibf.mp3","text":"新的一年开始了。你要是指望时间能改变些什么，我会劝你别想了。人的改变要付出数十倍于日常的努力，如果做得到，就证明给大家看看吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/h74lap60qntar1j2wkxruzk7pykonbo.mp3","text":"博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_284_spot/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/ijc9axmc4e69a7o6c6seya5qmom3k12.mp3","text":"工作就像是陷阱，你得主动跳进去才行。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/nmtpjpkbr2h9jnf94y47ogebg48eleb.mp3","text":"我不说话只是因为不想，没有看不起谁的意思。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/7nrg6mpbpzwkbyxo1ofbyswr3rzxko5.mp3","text":"月见夜又做什么了，他是不是终于因为在走廊上搭讪遭人讨厌甚至被送进医务室了？没有？真是遗憾。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/qbecerxktqns6dpf8bcm4hlw4aka7a3.mp3","text":"有事吗，博士？我大概能帮上点忙。不过，要是能不占用我用来看漫画的休息时间，当然会更好。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/b0yxbhm3b08clq3qjqm2f9uqfftrmzw.mp3","text":"虽然有时候我说话很直接，但该做的事情，我一定会做好。这不关职业道德什么事，只是我觉得连任务都没法完成的人，一定没有用心去做。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/neeojaql8f2vjeihun817cxa5vv2sks.mp3","text":"罗德岛是个奇怪的地方。这里的人有什么情绪都会说出来，有什么需要帮忙的地方就自然会有人伸出援手。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/qz94jfjs4ytngdvsu7mpohz6qixsrup.mp3","text":"虽然A6行动预备组的各位，不是每天摆着张臭脸就是没有自控能力，要么自我意识过剩或者根本是颗移动炸弹，但我依然觉得他们很可靠。因为他们真的在努力，哪怕是偷偷的。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/12/ixay7ew65u4t6bj7e5if1hzly9gdxje.mp3","text":"我以前也是个像诸位罗德岛干员一样自由自在的人，我的家庭却觉得那样的我是个怪胎。也许这里是个怪胎集合地也说不定，但至少，大家都很快乐。这样也不错。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/auei7tcoese5fyx5quwxkvnktb4ifuy.mp3","text":"我可以先回宿舍吗？","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/j69wm8hh6um5krorz8xhjhpmydhsy8y.mp3","text":"你好，我是隶属行动预备组A6的斑点，职责大概是保护预备组每天都在闹腾的另外几个家伙。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/5mspalripywlh3zt9gt9podinpih98d.mp3","text":"这场战斗我看过，敌人都完蛋了。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/4f2eeetz1j89j8eqvgy0mxu9663g4kv.mp3","text":"我会加倍努力工作的，从0.1到0.2的水平吧。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/md5cwy65xweop4rzadvmmh8piupc59y.mp3","text":"我就不询问这次作战的意义了。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/1iktjzcaykavr694h1cm0bcdixj1z8v.mp3","text":"我想回宿舍了。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/1npqblmho110gngwvww51jt55mb1a61.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/joukwtnpn7mfe0hh15bwxyljy7h6vix.mp3","text":"你们直接投降能节约我很多时间。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/on4k9kthunsyp6dszjzxswlrwrdiy96.mp3","text":"怎么样都行。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/dsy454tfwfr4g5esrdje0kantkv21p0.mp3","text":"我随便。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/0irnyur0m8756624pa53m8s8qmmmsoi.mp3","text":"就这样吧。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/t1zcfa0vegdyx0ql7g219hcpth4lc38.mp3","text":"挺好的。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/g0fyjmo59wonghpj4k8iq4q515fmhq5.mp3","text":"试试这个。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/fkuad9rak70q8j7zu28l2kv69wibfpx.mp3","text":"应该不会伤到队友。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/7ab6f54q8yvwvaulh0wtxcobsrb1vfh.mp3","text":"破绽太多了。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/ohloltgikjnaes1imwph0d5ac96ik3m.mp3","text":"举盾也是很累的。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/8c6435juxi1bazq9tzvukclbjqpkw8a.mp3","text":"每当你觉得一场战斗很轻松的时候，就最好再来一次。","alt":"voice/char_284_spot/cn_029.mp3"}],